Build lsteamclient with NDEBUG.

STEAMCLIENT_CALL asserts that every unix call succeeded. Without Mac Steam, CreateInterface must return NULL instead,
so SteamAPI_Init fails and the game falls back to its own login. The unix side has no assert(). Applies in
dlls/lsteamclient after neutron's proton 0001 and 0002.

License: Steamworks SDK license (a change to Valve's lsteamclient, whose sources are fetched at build time).

--- a/Makefile.in
+++ b/Makefile.in
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
 UNIX_LIBS = -lc++
 IMPORTS   = user32 ws2_32
 
-EXTRADEFS = -DSTEAM_API_EXPORTS -Dprivate=public -Dprotected=public
+EXTRADEFS = -DSTEAM_API_EXPORTS -Dprivate=public -Dprotected=public -DNDEBUG
 
 SOURCES = \
 	steam_input_manual.c \
